```console
$ scherzo-cloud project repository update --help
Change a project's configured default branch

Usage: scherzo-cloud project repository update [OPTIONS] --default-branch <DEFAULT_BRANCH> <ORGANIZATION> <PROJECT>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <PROJECT>       Exact project ID

Options:
      --default-branch <DEFAULT_BRANCH>
          Set the configured default branch
      --json
          Print the project result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->
          Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http
          Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help
          Print help

```
